Package: clipdeck
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 45), gjs, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.14), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5)
Homepage: https://github.com/divasatriaa/clipdeck
Description: Windows-style clipboard history for GNOME
 Clipdeck keeps a history of the text and images you copy, including
 PrtScr screenshots. Press Super+V to open it and click an item to paste it
 straight into the field you were typing in.
 .
 This package contains the GNOME Shell extension and the Clipdeck settings
 app, which turns the extension on and off and configures its shortcut,
 theme, animations and screenshot support.
